        "outdated": false,
        "first_comment": "This makes a list only when a key repeats. So the type of one field depends on how many boxes the user checks. I tested an `rx.checkbox_group` with `name=\"colors\"`:\n\n- 3 checked: `[\"red\", \"green\", \"bl"
